usage: module-nav string-search [-h] [-n N] [--module SS_MODULE] pattern

Regex search in indexed string literals (instant via SQLite). See also: `grep` for text in the
sources.

positional arguments:
  pattern               Pattern to search (substring or regex)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -n N                  Max results to show (default 50)
  --module, -m SS_MODULE
                        Filter to a specific module
